836
00:32:39,200 --> 00:32:43,919
So the rule here is the farther away the

837
00:32:41,919 --> 00:32:46,640
source is from the object, the lower the

838
00:32:43,919 --> 00:32:48,640
reconstruction resolution.

839
00:32:46,640 --> 00:32:51,279
This simulation is useful not only for

840
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:53,200
